{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Go Ape Ship!\u2019s cockpit and Moon voyage are completely free to play. A one-time upgrade to unlock the ship gives access to 7 additional rooms\u2014each with their own set of mini games\u2014and 5 new cosmic destinations.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Ape Ship! is a frantic co-op multiplayer game for one to eight players. Work  with your crew of daring Astrochimps to master an expanding collection of tasks, respond to emergencies, unlock new rooms and upgrades for your spaceship, and safely reach the stars. Survive together. Or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/ebf2adcd0de3b8be3e3a8210a2f2bd73.poster.avif?t=1769111711\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/ebf2adcd0de3b8be3e3a8210a2f2bd73.webm?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/ebf2adcd0de3b8be3e3a8210a2f2bd73.mp4?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In space, only your crewmates can hear you scream! Keep your spaceship on track by helping each other out with cooperative mini games. Be a pal and revive your downed teammates. Remember to ONLY use the reflex hammer to knock out your crewmates when it is medically necessary. And definitely DON\u2019T vent your friends into the dark and lonely void of outer space. Unless they deserve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/4a2ce992cbe30201ec2bdc07ee95b24e.poster.avif?t=1769111711\" width=1170 height=399 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/4a2ce992cbe30201ec2bdc07ee95b24e.webm?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAN YOUR STATIONS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to get down to monkey business! Fulfill your duties by completing the exciting mini games assigned to you. Adjust thrusters, power shields, cook delicious meals, poop in the bathroom (or not), and much more! But don\u2019t take too long, or things on your spaceship can go awry: fires, hull breaches, and space viruses, oh my!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/6cb2895949b5388bad96bfb481441c1b.poster.avif?t=1769111711\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/6cb2895949b5388bad96bfb481441c1b.webm?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/6cb2895949b5388bad96bfb481441c1b.mp4?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK YOUR SPACESHIP\u2019S FULL POTENTIAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship is your home away from home planet. As you successfully complete missions, you\u2019ll earn research points based on your performance. Use these hard-won points to unlock additional rooms in your spaceship, each with its own set of new mini games, and to furnish them with helpful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/97ac898fedd517924d2a1a04e411e6a2.poster.avif?t=1769111711\" width=1170 height=399 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/97ac898fedd517924d2a1a04e411e6a2.webm?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAVEL THE STARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bon voyage! Journey to 6 destinations across the Solar System. But beware! As you travel further from sweet Mother Earth, you\u2019ll be assigned more tasks to keep your spaceship spaceworthy, and space emergencies will become increasingly common.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/29ed0795bbe755c42f3a00c3d9619dda.poster.avif?t=1769111711\" width=1170 height=399 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/extras/29ed0795bbe755c42f3a00c3d9619dda.webm?t=1769111711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the stars with a trusty crew of 1 to 8 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master more than 40 exciting mini games to operate your spaceship, respond to emergencies, and keep your Astrochimps fit for duty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, unlock, and upgrade your spaceship\u2019s 8 distinct rooms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself across 6 difficulty settings, including an endless mode, to trek across the Solar System and beyond!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037180?t=1769111711","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/43b9c3f0927d90853db6357755a559a8388d9724/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769111711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/8ea68729c1c7061fc2f2a14d3d003e99f1d202b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769111711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037180/8ea68729c1c7061fc2f2a14d3d003e99f1d202b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769111711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Go Ape Ship!\u2019s cockpit and Moon voyage are completely free to play. A one-time upgrade to unlock the ship gives access to 7 additional rooms\u2014each with their own set of mini games\u2014and 5 new cosmic destinations.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Ape Ship! is a frantic co-op multiplayer game for one to eight players. Work  with your crew of daring Astrochimps to master an expanding collection of tasks, respond to emergencies, unlock new rooms and upgrades for your spaceship, and safely reach the stars. Survive together. Or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline pos